{"source_id": "S0113", "status": "read", "units": [{"location": "paragraph:1", "text": "行测知识模拟测试题", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:2", "text": "第一部分 语言理解与表达", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:3", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:4", "text": "1、春天翻动思绪，春景使人联想，行到水穷处，坐看云起时，都是哲人对春天的一种见解，沐浴春天的一种方式，对春天的理解_________，春天呈现的种类自然也就__________。依次填入划横线部分最恰当的一项是（　）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:5", "text": "　　A.莫衷一是　千变万化　　 B.因人而异　千姿百态", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:6", "text": "　　C.浮想联翩　姹紫嫣红　　 D.众说纷纭　千娇百媚", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:7", "text": "2、发展低碳和生态经济，应加快实施产业化工程，积极培育大型骨干企业，实施________开发利用，确保资源在产业中得到最有效________。填入横线部分最恰当的一项是（　）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:8", "text": "　　A.程序化　配置　　 B.规模化　整合 C.规模化　配置　　 D.程序化　整合", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:9", "text": "3、阅读习惯与阅读兴趣关系密切，二者相辅相成。良好的阅读习惯以阅读兴趣为基础、为_____；阅读兴趣又在良好阅读习惯的长期_____下，不断强化，得以巩固。填入横线部分最恰当的一项是（　）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:10", "text": "　　A.目标　推动　　 B.核心　影响 C.动力　引导　　 D.源泉　培养", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:11", "text": "4、发达国家应_____向发展中国家提供资金和技术转让的承诺，更加_________开展国际合作，探索可持续发展框架下适合各国国情的低碳发展共同道路。填入横线部分最恰当的一项是（　）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:12", "text": "　　A.兑现　广阔地　　 B.兑付　广阔地 C.兑现　广泛地　　 D.兑付　广泛地", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:13", "text": "5、这场目前只略见__________的革命，其未来的发展前景应该是_______的。填入横线部分最恰当的一项是（　）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:14", "text": "A.希望　光明　　 B.光明　璀璨 C.端倪　辉煌　　 D.开端　辉煌", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:15", "text": "6、春天翻动思绪，春景使人联想，行到水穷处，坐看云起时，都是哲人对春天的一种见解，沐浴春天的一种方式，对春天的理解        ，春天呈现的种类自然也就        。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:16", "text": "填入横线部分最恰当的一项是：", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:17", "text": "A.莫衷一是　千变万化    B.因人而异　千姿百态", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:18", "text": "C.浮想联翩　姹紫嫣红       D.众说纷纭　千娇百媚", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:19", "text": "7、一部本来颇有可能写成论文状的著作，读来却丝毫没有艰涩之感，反而        ，实在        。要知道，在这样一个高速运转的社会里，一本        的书往往会被放在桌子上做临时杯垫用。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:20", "text": "填入横线部分最恰当的一项是：", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:21", "text": "A.妙趣横生   难能可贵   令人费解", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:22", "text": "B.引人入胜   匠心独具   高深莫测", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:23", "text": "C.深入浅出   叹为观止   曲高和寡", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:24", "text": "D.平易近人   不可多得   枯燥无味", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:25", "text": "8、选出解说有误的一项是（    ）", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:26", "text": "                           惠崇《春江晚景》  苏轼", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:27", "text": "                        竹外桃花三两枝，春江水暖鸭先知。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:28", "text": "                        蒌蒿满地芦芽短，正是河豚欲上时。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:29", "text": "    A、这是宋代诗人苏轼在惠崇所作的画上题写的七言绝句。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:30", "text": "    B、全诗通过对画面景物的描写，结合联想，显示了早春自然界的勃勃生机，形象真实，意境清新。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:31", "text": "    C、第三、四句实写了画中的景物，如鲜嫩的蒌蒿、短壮的芦芽、逆水上游的河豚。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:32", "text": "D、第一句中的“三两枝”说明时间是早春。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:33", "text": "9、下列各句中，没有语病的一句是（    ）", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:34", "text": "A. 李平同学不仅学习好，乐于帮助其他同学，因此我们要向他学习。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:35", "text": "B. 党的好干部杨善洲是近年来我省涌现出的英雄模范人物之一。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:36", "text": "C. 日本能否在短时间内消除核泄漏带来的严重污染，依赖于科学技术及政府的重视。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:37", "text": "D. 通过新交通法的颁布实施，使酒后驾车的人越来越少了。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:38", "text": "10、下列句子中没有语病的一项是（    ）", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:39", "text": "A. 温家宝总理出席第四次中日韩领导人会议，提议建立中日韩核电安全交流与合作机制。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:40", "text": "B. 就近期一些地方因征地拆迁引发恶性事件，国土资源部日前下发紧急通知，要求各地严格规范征地拆迁管理，坚决防范强征强拆行为不再发生。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:41", "text": "C. 制度的优越、国力的强大是中国撤离在利比亚人员行动能否取得成功的坚实基础。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:42", "text": "D. 学校开展的“感恩·奋进”活动，掀起了同学间互帮、互助、互学、互进，增进了彼此的友谊。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:43", "text": "11、 下列各句中没有歧义的一句是( )。 ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:44", "text": "A、这是一个十分有趣的人，他的笑话讲不完 ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:45", "text": "B、在《我的首长》这篇文章中，他写了许多感人的故事 ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:46", "text": "C、小王回到了宿舍，发现老朱和他的朋友仍然在那里聊天 ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:47", "text": "D、董事长看到总经理非常高兴，不由分说地把他拉到了办公室 ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:48", "text": "12、 下边语句没有歧义的一句是( )。 ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:49", "text": "A、张老师家里收藏了许多俄国著名作家屠格涅夫的书 ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:50", "text": "B、走进大殿，中间是阎王的塑像，西边站着两个判官 ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:51", "text": "C、要像勇士那样生活，用英勇的气慨去战胜灾难 ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:52", "text": "D、在场的所有人中，只有韩履正跟刘国清学过几句日语", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:53", "text": "13.新闻侵权：是指新闻单位或者个人利用大众传播媒介以故意捏造事实或者过失报道等形式向受众传播内容违法或失实的新闻，从而侵害公民和法人的合法权益的行为。新闻侵权可分为刑事犯罪行为和民事违法行为，前者主要是诽谤罪，指“捏造事实诽谤他人，情节严重”的行为。后者主要是指侵害著作权、肖像权、名誉权和隐私权。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:54", "text": " 以下不属于侵权行为的是：", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:55", "text": " A.某电视台大肆宣传包治百病的某种秘方药物，引来观众的阵阵声讨", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:56", "text": " B.某杂志未经刘翔允许，擅自将其在奥运会上的跨栏照片当作封面", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:57", "text": " C.某电台为名不副实的增高产品“高乐宝”做广告，欺骗了许多消费者", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:58", "text": " D.某出版社经过鲁迅先生家属的同意，再次修定出版《鲁迅全集》", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:59", "text": " 14.原始取得是指根据法律规定，最初取得财产的所有权或不依赖于原所有人的意志而取得财产的所有权。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:60", "text": " 下列不属于原始取得的是：", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:61", "text": " A.农民种植并收获的粮食", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:62", "text": " B.老王养的牛产下的牛犊", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:63", "text": " C.违法犯罪分子的财产收归国家所有", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:64", "text": " D.朋友赠送的礼物", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:65", "text": " 15.受贿：国家工作人员、集体经济组织工作售货员或者其他从事公务的人员，利用职务上的便利，索取或者非法收受他人财物，为他人谋取利益的行为。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:66", "text": " 根据以上定义，下面哪种行为是受贿？", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:67", "text": " A.甲是某厂财务主管，在给乙报销时，多报销2000元，事后与乙某平分，二个各得1000元", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:68", "text": " B.卫某（女）因盗窃金店而被公安机关收审，贾某负责审理这个案子。卫某想贾某帮助她，即以身相许，尔后贾某便利用自己的职权设法使卫某逃避了法律制裁", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:69", "text": " C.刘某想倒卖彩电，就托人找到电视机厂主管彩电批发王某，送去10000元人民币，希望王某按批发价卖给他100台彩电。王某收到钱后交给了领导", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:70", "text": " D.王某主管某单位分房子，李某为了给他在该单位工作的儿子分得一套住房，就给王某送到价值5000元的厚礼，王某得到钱后给甲的儿子分了房子", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:71", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:72", "text": "第二部分 数学能力", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:73", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:74", "text": "【16】1，1, 2, 2, 3, 4, 3, 5, ( ) ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:75", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:76", "text": "【17】1，52, 313, 174，( )", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:77", "text": "A.5；B.515；C.525；D.545；", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:78", "text": " ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:79", "text": "【18】5, 15, 10, 215, ( )", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:80", "text": "A、415；B、-115；C、445；D、-112；", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:81", "text": " ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:82", "text": "【19】-7，0, 1, 2, 9, ( )", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:83", "text": "  A、12；B、18；C、24；D、28；", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:84", "text": " ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:85", "text": "【20】0，1，3，10，( )", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:86", "text": "  A、101；B、102；C、103；D、104；", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:87", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:88", "text": "21. 从0，1，2，7，9五个数字中任选四个不重复的数字，组成的最大四位数和最小四位数的差是（  ）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:89", "text": "A. 8442  B. 8694  C. 8740  D. 9694", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:90", "text": "22. 一块试验田，以前这块地所种植的是普通水稻。现在将该试验田的1/3种上超级水稻，收割时发现该试验田水稻总产量是以前总产量的1.5倍。如果普通水稻的产量不变，则超级水稻的平均产量与普通水稻的平均产量之比是（  ）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:91", "text": "A. 5∶2  B. 4∶3  C. 3∶1  D. 2∶1", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:92", "text": "23. 人工生产某种装饰用珠链，每条珠链需要珠子25颗，丝线3条，搭扣1对，以及10分钟的单个人工劳动。现有珠子4880颗，丝线586条，搭扣200对，4个工人。则8小时最多可以生产珠链（  ）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:93", "text": "A. 200条  B. 195条  C. 193条  D. 192条", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:94", "text": "24. A、B两地以一条公路相连。甲车从A地，乙车从B地以不同的速度沿公路匀速率相向开出。两车相遇后分别掉头，并以对方的速率行进。甲车返回A地后又一次掉头以同样的速率沿公路向B地开动。最后甲、乙两车同时到达B地。如果最开始时甲车的速率为X米/秒，则最开始时乙车的速率为（  ）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:95", "text": "A. 4X米/秒  B. 2X米/秒  C. 0.5X米/秒  D. 无法判断", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:96", "text": "25. 有甲、乙两个项目组。乙组任务临时加重时，从甲组抽调了四分之一的组员。此后甲组任务也有所加重，于是又从乙组调回了重组后乙组人数的十分之一。此时甲组与乙组人数相等。由此可以得出结论（  ）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:97", "text": "A. 甲组原有16人，乙组原有11人    B. 甲、乙两组原组员人数之比为16∶11", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:98", "text": "C. 甲组原有11人，乙组原有16人   D. 甲、乙两组原组员人数比为11∶16", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:99", "text": "26. 某市居民生活用电每月标准用电量的基本价格为每度0.50元，若每月用电量超过标准用电量，超出部分按其基本价格的80%收费，某户九月份用电84度，共交电费39.6元，则该市每月标准用电量为（  ）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:100", "text": "A. 60度  B. 65度    C. 70度   D. 75度", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:101", "text": "27.现有50名学生都做物理、化学实验，如果物理实验做正确的有40人，化学实验做正确的有31人，两种实验都做错的有4人，则两种实验都做对的有（  ）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:102", "text": "A. 27人  B. 25人  C.19人  D. 10", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:103", "text": "28. 有关部门要连续审核30个科研课题方案，如果要求每天安排审核的课题个数互不相等且不为零，则审核完这些课题最多需要（  ）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:104", "text": "A.7天  B.8天  C.9天  D. 10天", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:105", "text": "29.一个五位数，左边三位数是右边两位数的5倍，如果把右边的两位数移到前面，则所得新的五位数要比原来的五位数的2倍还多75，则原来的五位数是（  ）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:106", "text": "A. 12525  B. 13527  C. 17535  D. 22545", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:107", "text": "30. 从12时到13时，钟的时针与分针可成直角的机会有（  ）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:108", "text": "A. 1次   B. 2次   C. 3次   D. 4次", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:109", "text": "31. 四人进行篮球传接球练习，要求每人接球后再传给别人。开始由甲发球，并作为第一次传球，若第五次传球后，球又回到甲手中，则共有传球方式（  ）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:110", "text": "A. 60种  B. 65种  C. 70种  D. 75种", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:111", "text": "32. 为了把2008年北京奥运办成绿色奥运，全国各地都在加强环保，植树造林。某单位计划在通往两个比赛场馆的两条路的（不相交）两旁栽上树，现运回一批树苗，已知一条路的长度是另一条路长度的两倍还多6000米，若每隔4米栽一棵，则少2754棵；若每隔5米栽一棵，则多396棵，则共有树苗（  ）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:112", "text": "A. 8500棵   B. 12500棵   C. 12596棵   D. 13000棵", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:113", "text": "33. 在一条公路上每隔100公里有一个仓库，共有5个仓库，一号仓库存有10吨货物，二号仓库存有20吨货物，五号仓库存有40吨货物，其余两个仓库是空的。现在要把所有的货物集中存放在一个仓库里，如果每吨货物运输1公里需要0.5元运输费，则最少需要运费（  ）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:114", "text": "A. 4500元   B. 5000元  C. 5500元  D. 6000元", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:115", "text": "34. 某原料供应商对购买其原料的顾客实行如下优惠措施：①一次购买金额不超过1万元，不予优惠；②一次购买金额超过1万元，但不超过3万元，给九折优惠；③一次购买金额超过3万元，其中3万元九折优惠，超过3万元部分八折优惠。某厂因库容原因，第一次在该供应商处购买原料付款7800元，第二次购买付款26100元，如果他一次购买同样数量的原料，可以少付（  ）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:116", "text": "A. 1460元  B. 1540元  C. 3780元  D. 4360元", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:117", "text": "35. 一个三位数除以9余7，除以5余2，除以4余3，这样的三位数共有（  ）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:118", "text": "A. 5个   B. 6个    C. 7个    D. 8个", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:119", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:120", "text": "第三部分 判断推理", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:121", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:122", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:123", "text": "\u0001", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": true}, {"location": "paragraph:124", "text": "6、欧洲的舞蹈批评家：美国芭蕾水平的提高是由于现在有更多的欧洲人在美国教授芭蕾。在美国的芭蕾教师中，在欧洲出生并接受训练的教师比例上升了，我知道这一点是因为在我去年去纽约时，我所遇见的欧洲来的芭蕾教师——在欧洲出生并接受训练——比从前要多。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:125", "text": "　　下列哪一项指出了该舞蹈批评家在推理中所使用的一项有疑问的假设?", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:126", "text": "　　A.该论述忽视了一种可能，即美国的一些芭蕾教师可能出生在欧洲但却是在美国接受的训练。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:127", "text": "　　B.该论述假设该批评家在其去年去纽约时遇见的教师群在这类教师中具有典型代表性。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:128", "text": "　　C.该论述假设美国的芭蕾教学水平比欧洲的要高。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:129", "text": "　　D.没有考虑导致美国舞蹈家思想状态水平上升的其他可能原因。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:130", "text": "　　E.该论述假设在欧洲出生并受识破的舞蹈家一般比在美国出生并受识破的舞蹈家天赋更高。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:131", "text": "7、为保护海边建筑免遭海洋风暴的袭击，海洋度假地在海滩和建筑之间建起了巨大的防海墙。这些防海墙不仅遮住了一些建筑物的海景，而且使海岸本身也变窄了。这是因为在风暴从水的一边对沙子进行侵蚀的时候，沙子不再向内陆扩展。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:132", "text": "　　如果上述信息正确，那些从其出发，下列哪一项得到了最有力的支持?", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:133", "text": "　　A.由于海洋风暴的猛烈程度不断加深，必须在海洋和海边财产之间建立起更多的高大防海墙。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:134", "text": "　　B.即使是在海滩被人类滥用着的时候，它们对于许多使用它们的野生物种的生存来说依然是必不可少的。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:135", "text": "　　C.用来保护海边建筑的防海墙如果要保护那些建筑，它们自己最终不会被风暴破坏，也不需要昂贵的维修和更新。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:136", "text": "　　D.为以后的世代保留下海滩应该是海岸管理的首要目标。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:137", "text": "　　E.对于一个想要维护自己海滩疗养地功能的海边社区来说，通过建筑防海墙来保护海边建筑的努力，从长远来看，其作用是适得其反的。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:138", "text": "8、甲、乙、丙三人讨论“不劳动者不得食”这一原则所包含的意义。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:139", "text": "　　甲说：“不劳动者不得食，意味着得食者可以不劳动。”", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:140", "text": "　　乙说：‘“不劳动者不得食，意味着得食者必须是劳动者。”", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:141", "text": "　　丙说：“不劳动者不得食，意味着得食者可能是劳动者。”", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:142", "text": "　　以下哪项结论是正确的？", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:143", "text": "　　A.甲的意见正确，乙和丙的意见不正确。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:144", "text": "　　B.乙和丙的意见正确，甲的意见不正确。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:145", "text": "　　C.甲和丙的意见正确，乙的意见不正确。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:146", "text": "　　D.乙的意见正确，甲和丙的意见不正确。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:147", "text": "　　E.丙的意见正确，甲和己的意见不正确。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:148", "text": "9、加拿大人现在越来越多地加入“境外购物”，即越过国界到价格较低的地方购物。加拿大以外的价格要低很多，很大一部分原因是支付给加拿大社会服务体系的商品和服务税不再适用。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:149", "text": "　　根据以上的信息，下面哪个说法最可以被支持?", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:150", "text": "　　A.如果境外购物的上升趋势继续保持在较高的水平，并且政府支付给加拿大社会服务体系的金额不变，估计加拿大的商品和服务税税率就会上升。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:151", "text": "　　B.如果加拿大对从境外购买的商品征收较多的关税，另一个方向上别国也会相应地对从加拿大购买的商品征收关税，从而损害加拿大的商业。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:152", "text": "　　C.加拿大政府支付给为加拿大人提供社会服务的人的资金数额一直在增加。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:153", "text": "　　D.同样品牌的商品，加拿大顾客在境外和在国内都可以买到。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:154", "text": "　　E.境外购物所购商品在购物者越过边界进入加拿大境内时，要交纳加拿大规定的税收。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:155", "text": "10、某国政府决策者面临的一个头痛的问题就是所谓的“别在我家门口”综合症。例如，尽管民意测验一次又一次地显示公众大多数都赞成建造新的监狱，但是，当决策者正式宣布计划要在某地建造一新的监狱时，总遭到附近居民的抗议，并且抗议者往往总有办法使计划搁浅。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:156", "text": "　　以下哪项也属于上面所说的“别在我家门口”综合症？", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:157", "text": "　　A.某家长主张，感染了艾滋病毒的孩子不能允许入公共学校。当知道一个感染了艾滋病毒的孩子进入了他孩子的学校，他立即办理了自己孩子的退学手续。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:158", "text": "　　B.某政客主张所有政府官员必须履行个人财产公开登记，他自己递交了一份虚假的财产登记表。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:159", "text": "　　C.某教授主张宗教团体有义务从事慈善事业，但自己拒绝捐款资助索马里饥民。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:160", "text": "　　D.某汽车商主张国际汽车自由贸易，以有利于各国经济，但要求本国政府限制外国制造的汽车进口。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:161", "text": "　　E.某军事战略家认为核战争足以毁灭人类，但主张本国保持足够的核能力以抵御外部可能的核袭击。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:162", "text": "11、左撇子的人比右撇子的人更经常患有免疫功能失调症，比如过敏。但是左撇子往往在完成由大脑右半球控制的任务上比右撇子具有优势，并且大多数人的数学推理能力都受到大脑右半球的强烈影响。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:163", "text": "　　如果以上的信息正确，它最能支持下面哪个假设?", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:164", "text": "　　A.大多数患有过敏或其他免疫功能失调症的人是左撇子而非右撇子。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:165", "text": "　　B.大多数左撇子的数学家患有某种过敏症。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:166", "text": "　　C.数学推理能力强于平均水平的人中，左撇子的人的比例，要高于数学推理能力弱于平均水平的人中的左撇子比例。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:167", "text": "　　D.如果一位左撇子患有过敏症，他很可能擅长数学。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:168", "text": "　　E.比起左撇子的人或者数学推理能力不寻常地好的人所占的比例来讲，患有过敏等免疫功能失调症的人的比例要高一些。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:169", "text": "12、 M公司的最新产品成本是如此之低，以至于公司不大可能在出售产品时不增加公司通常允许赚取的成本加价：潜在的客户可能完全不能相信这么便宜的东西会真好使。但M公司的信誉是建立在仅包括合理的边际利润的公平价格基础上的。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:170", "text": "　　以上的论述，如果正确，最强有力地支持了下面哪个?", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:171", "text": "　　A.M公司在试图为其最新产品定价、使价格能在不损害公司信誉的前提下促进销售时会遇到困难。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:172", "text": "　　B.尽管售出的每件产品利润很小，但通过大规模的销售，M公司仍取得了巨大的年利润。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:173", "text": "　　C.M公司在为其最新产品计算生产成本时犯了计算错误。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:174", "text": "　　D.M公司的最新产品将要执行的任务是其他制造成本更低的设备也能胜任的。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:175", "text": "　　E.M公司的生产程序的设计和该公司制造的产品一样具有新颖之处。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:176", "text": "13、报上登出了国内20家大医院的名单，名单按它们在近3年中病人死亡率的高低排序。专家指出不能把名单排列的倾序作为评价这些医院的医疗水平的一个标准。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:177", "text": "　　以下各项，如果是真的，都能作论据支持专家的结论，除了", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:178", "text": "　　A.这20家医院中，有5家依靠国家资助从国外进口了多项先进、大型和配套的医疗设备，其余的都没有。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:179", "text": "　　B.有些医院，留病人住院的时间长，病人死亡率因此就较高；有些医院，往往较早地动员患绝症而救治无望的病人出院，病人死亡率因此就较低。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:180", "text": "　　C.这20家医院中，有2家老人医院和3家儿童医院。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:181", "text": "　　D.在20家医院中，有2家是肿瘤医院。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:182", "text": "　　E.有些医院不具备特种手术和特别护理条件，碰到相关的病人就转院了事。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:183", "text": "14、大学图书管理员：三年以前，非学生读者使用本图书馆是免费的。后来，因为我们的预算减少了，所以我们要求他们每年支付100美元的费用。然而，仍然约有150名非学生读者使用了图书馆而没有缴费。因此，如果我们雇用一名警卫来辨认非学生读者并令其缴费，那么我们就可以获得经济收益。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:184", "text": "　　下列哪一项对于评价图书管理员的结论是最为重要的?", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:185", "text": "　　(A)每年使用图书馆的学生人数。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:186", "text": "　　(B)今年图书馆的预算。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:187", "text": "　　(C)图书馆是否安装了昂贵的计算机分类系统。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:188", "text": "　　(D)三年前图书馆的预算降低了多少。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:189", "text": "　　(E)图书馆雇用一名警卫每年的成本是多少。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:190", "text": "15、某仓库被窃。经过侦破，查明作某的人部是甲、乙、丙、丁四个人中的一个人。审讯中，四个人的口供如下：", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:191", "text": "　　甲：“仓库被窃的那一天，我在别的城市，因此我是不可能作案的。”", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:192", "text": "　　乙：“丁就是罪犯。”", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:193", "text": "　　丙：“乙是盗窃仓库的罪犯，因为我亲眼看见他那一天进过仓库。”", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:194", "text": "　　丁：“乙是有意陷害我。”", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:195", "text": "　　现假定这四个人的口供中，只有一个人讲的是真话。那么", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:196", "text": "　　A.甲是盗窃仓库的罪犯。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:197", "text": "　　B.乙是盗窃仓库的罪犯。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:198", "text": "　　C.丙是盗窃仓库的罪犯。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:199", "text": "　　D.丁是盗窃仓库的罪犯。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:200", "text": "　　E.甲、乙、丙、丁都不是盗窃仓库的罪犯。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:201", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:202", "text": "第四部分 材料分析", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:203", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:204", "text": "一、根据下面的统计表回答131～135题。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:205", "text": "某大专院校教师情况", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:206", "text": "类别", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:207", "text": "年度", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:208", "text": "\t老年", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:209", "text": "\t中年", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:210", "text": "\t青年", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:211", "text": "\t", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:212", "text": "\t", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:213", "text": "\t男", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:214", "text": "\t女", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:215", "text": "\t男", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:216", "text": "\t女", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:217", "text": "\t男", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:218", "text": "\t女", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:219", "text": "\t", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:220", "text": "\t1996", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:221", "text": "\t120", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:222", "text": "\t60", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:223", "text": "\t240", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:224", "text": "\t120", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:225", "text": "\t100", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:226", "text": "\t40", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:227", "text": "\t", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:228", "text": "\t1997", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:229", "text": "\t210", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:230", "text": "\t40", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:231", "text": "\t320", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:232", "text": "\t200", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:233", "text": "\t200", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:234", "text": "\t120", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:235", "text": "\t", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:236", "text": "\t1998", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:237", "text": "\t300", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:238", "text": "\t150", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:239", "text": "\t400", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:240", "text": "\t270", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:241", "text": "\t320", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:242", "text": "\t280", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:243", "text": "\t", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:244", "text": "\t", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:245", "text": "1．该校教师最多的是哪一年?（    ）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:246", "text": "A．1996            B．1997               C．1998              D．不清楚", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:247", "text": "2．哪一年青年男教师的增长幅度最大?（    ）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:248", "text": "A．1996            B．1997               C．1998              D．不清楚", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:249", "text": "3．1996年到1998年，该校哪一个年龄段的男教师人数增加最多?其增长率为多少?（    ）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:250", "text": "A．老年200%                             B．中年167%", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:251", "text": "C．青年220%                             D．中年233%", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:252", "text": "4．该校1997年男女教师的比例为多少?（    ）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:253", "text": "A．2∶1              B．2．1∶1          C．1．5∶1             D．不清楚", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:254", "text": "5．下面说法正确的是（    ）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:255", "text": "A．1997年男教师最多", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:256", "text": "B．1998年女教师最少", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:257", "text": "C．1997年中年男教师比1996年多80人", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:258", "text": "D．1998年青年男女教师的比例为1．5∶1", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:259", "text": "二、根据下列文字材料回答116～120题。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:260", "text": "国泰摩托募集大量资金，主要用途：（1）投资4 883．6万元用于冲压生产线技术改造，年创效益1 475万元。（2）投资4 958．5万元用于焊接生产线技术改造，年创效益1 980万元。（3）投资4 957．9万元用于发动机箱体、箱盖生产线技术改造，年创效益2 039．29万元。（4）投资4 955．3万元用于发动机曲轴连杆生产线技术改造，年创效益2 376．5万元。（5）投资4 850．5万元用于塑料注塑成型加工生产线技术改造，年创效益1 980万元。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:261", "text": "6．在（1）～（5）中哪一项投资最大？（    ）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:262", "text": "A．（1）          B．（2）            C．（3）                D．（4）", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:263", "text": "7．在（1）～（5）中，哪一项创效益最少？（    ）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:264", "text": "A．（1）          B．（2）            C．（3）                D．（5）", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:265", "text": "8．总共投资多少？（    ）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:266", "text": "A．24 605．8万       B．19 853．6万  C．27 632．4万        D．21 672．4万", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:267", "text": "9．年创效益共为多少？（    ）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:268", "text": "A．9 850．79万          B．8 972．56万  C．9 349．27万        D．9 172．38万", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:269", "text": "10．年创效益占投资额的比重为多少？（    ）。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:270", "text": "A．40%          B．37．2%            C．43．1%             D．51．2%", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:271", "text": "1、【解析】B。这道题主要考查对成语意义的理解。莫衷一是：形容意见分歧，不能决定哪个是对的，没有一致的看法。“对春天的理解”无所谓正误，排除A项。因人而异：因人的不同而有所差异。众说纷纭：人多嘴杂，议论纷纷。浮想联翩：指许许多多飘浮不定的想象不断涌现出来。形容一个人对某事物的想法很多。题干中是不同人对同一事物的理解，故排除C项。千姿百态：形容姿态多种多样或种类丰富。千娇百媚：形容女子的姿态美丽动人。题干形容“春天呈现的种类”显然用“千娇百媚”不太恰当，排除D项。故本题正确答案为B项。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:272", "text": "2、【解析】C。“程序”，事情进行的先后秩序。“规模”，（事业、工程、运动、机构等）所具有的格局、形式或包含的范围。大型骨干企业可以对资源进行大范围的开发利用，第一空选择“规模化”。发展低碳和生态经济，要使资源在各产业中得到有效的配备布置，第二空应选择“配置”。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:273", "text": "3、【解析】C。阅读兴趣能促使良好的阅读习惯的养成，故第一空应选择“动力”；良好的阅读习惯引导、激发阅读兴趣的强化，第二空应填入“引导”，故本题正确答案为C。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:274", "text": "4、【解析】C。“兑现”，比喻实现诺言。“兑付”，凭票据支付现款。“广阔”，广大宽阔，重在“阔”。“广泛”，范围广大，重在“泛”。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:275", "text": "5、【解析】C。“希望”：心里想着达到某种目的或出现某种情况。“端倪”：事情的眉目，头绪、边际。“光明”：比喻正义的或者希望的。“开端”：事情的起头、开头。“辉煌”：光辉灿烂；（成绩等）显著，卓著。“璀璨”形容珠玉等光彩鲜明。“略见端倪”是固定搭配，本题选C。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:276", "text": "6、解析：B。由第二空入手，A项“千变万化”形容变化极多；B项“千姿百态”形容姿态多种多样或种类丰富；C项“姹紫嫣红”形容各种花卉娇艳、美丽；D项“千娇百媚”形容女子姿态美丽动人。根据题干中的“种类”可知“千姿百态”符合题意。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:277", "text": "7、解析：本题答案选A。由“反而”可知，第一空应与“艰涩之感”形成反义对应关系，“引人入胜”多用来指风景或文艺作品特别吸引人，偏重于文学作品情节的设置，与强调深奥晦涩的“艰涩”无法形成反义对应关系，可排除B；根据行文顺序，第二空着重突出这本著作难得的优点，但上升到“叹为观止”的地步则程度过重，由此排除C；由“做临时杯垫用”可知，第三空应与“艰涩之感”同义，“令人费解”恰好呼应了深奥晦涩难懂的词义。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:278", "text": "8、\t解析：C。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:279", "text": "9、B【解析】A句关联词语使用不当，“不仅”和“因此”不能搭配；C句前后不一致，“能否”与后一分句不能形成对应关系；D句成分残缺，误用介词造成句子主语残缺。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:280", "text": "10、A【解析】B句重复，应该删去“不再”；C句“基础”后加“之一”；Ｄ句“掀起了”与“互帮、互助、互学、互进”搭配不当，是成分残缺，“互帮、互助、互学、互进”后加上“的高潮”。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:281", "text": "11、B", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:282", "text": "12、A", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:283", "text": "13．【答案】D。解析：新闻侵权的定义要点是：侵害公民和法人的合法权益。D项出版社再次修定出版《鲁迅全集》是经过鲁迅先生家属同意的，不符合该要点，故答案选D。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:284", "text": "14.【答案】D。解析：原始取得有两种情况：①最初取得财产的所有权；②不依赖于原所有人的意志而取得财产的所有权。A、B两项都符合①；C项符合②；D项既不是最初取得的，并且依赖于朋友的赠送，故不符合定义。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:285", "text": "15．【答案】D。解析：受贿的定义要点是：①索取或非法收受他人财物；②为他人谋取利益的行为。A项不符合要点①②；B项不符合要点①；C项王某将钱交给领导，不符合①②。D项符合所有要点，故答案选D。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:286", "text": "16.分析：思路一：1，（1，2），2，（3，4），3，（5，6）=>分1、2、3和（1，2），（3，4），（5，6）两组。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:287", "text": "思路二：第一项、第四项、第七项为一组；第二项、第五项、第八项为一组；第三项、第六项、第九项为一组=>1,2,3;1,3,5;2,4,6=>三组都是等差", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:288", "text": "17.分析：选B，52中5除以2余1(第一项)；313中31除以3余1(第一项)；174中17除以4余1(第一项)；515中51除以5余1(第一项)", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:289", "text": "18.答：选B，前一项的平方减后一项等于第三项，5×5-15=10；15×15-10=215；10×10-215=-115", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:290", "text": "19.答：选D，-7=(-2)3+1；0=(-1)3+1；1=03+1；2=13+1；9=23+1；28=33+1", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:291", "text": "20.答：选B，思路一：0×0+1=1，1×1+2=3，3×3+1=10，10×10+2=102；思路二：0(第一项)2+1=1(第二项)12+2=332+1=10102+2=102,其中所加的数呈1,2,1,2规律。思路三：各项除以3，取余数=>0,1,0,1,0，奇数项都能被3整除，偶数项除3余1；", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:292", "text": "21、B解析：9721-1027。尾数分析结果是答案尾数4。通过估算答案小于9000，所以选B。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:293", "text": "22、A解析：采用特殊值法。设共3块试验田，原产量分别为1,1,1。共产3。现在总产量4.5，也就是说三块地产量分别为1,1,2.5。所以超级水稻的平均产量与普通水稻的平均产量之比是2.5:1。选A。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:294", "text": "23、D解析：计算出最缺少的资源是什么。4880\u0001195.2586\u0001195.333333200\u00018×60×4÷10=192最缺少劳动力。所以选D。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": true}, {"location": "paragraph:295", "text": "24、B解析：甲速走一个全程的时间乙速走两个全程，所以乙初始速度是甲的2倍。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:296", "text": "25、B解析：甲组抽调了四分之一的组员，所以排除C,D选项。比较AB选项发现A对则B也对，所以选B。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:297", "text": "26、A解析：超出部分每度0.4元，用电84度至少交电费84\u00010.4=33.6。现多交电费39.6-33.6=6元，是因为标准之内每度电多收0.1元。所以标准用电6\u00010.1=60度。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": true}, {"location": "paragraph:298", "text": "27、B解析：用包含与排除公式，都作对的有40+31-50+4=25人。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:299", "text": "28、A解析：1+2+3+4+5+6+7=281+2+3+4+5+6+9=30", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:300", "text": "如果答案超过7，导致课题数至少1+2+3+4+5+6+7+8=36矛盾。所以选A。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:301", "text": "29、A解析：正整数与他的数字和同余，在模9的时候。右边的两位数移到前面数字和不变，则除以9余数不变。设原数n，\u0001", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": true}, {"location": "paragraph:302", "text": "解得n除以9余6。考察选项的数字和，选A。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:303", "text": "30、B解析：12时15分到12时20分之间一次，12时45到12时50之间一次。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:304", "text": "31、A解析：第一次可以传给另外三人中的任何一人，此时这三人地位平等，所以答案是3的倍数。答案不会是75。因为不考虑球回到甲，共\u0001=81种路线。如果答案是75，则共有81-75=6种路线不回到甲，6/3=2。就是说甲——乙——（）", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": true}, {"location": "paragraph:305", "text": "——（）——（）——（）这样的路线只有2条不会到甲，这是明显错误的。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:306", "text": "32、D解析：选项差距较大，估算即可。不考虑路的端点，4米一颗和5米一颗用掉的树苗比例5:4，相差的一份就是2754+396=3150。树苗的数目比4份多396。3150×4+396=12996选D", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:307", "text": "33、B解析：5号仓库货物重量大于其余仓库总和，所以都运到5号仓库。总运费0.5\u0001（10\u0001）\u0001100=5000元", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": true}, {"location": "paragraph:308", "text": "34、A解析：26100<27000,说明第二次是少于30000打了9折。原价26100/0.9=29000。如果合到一起买，7800元中的1000元打9折，6800元打8折。全打9折省780，全打8折省1560。答案在AB中。B选项过于接近8折，排除掉。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:309", "text": "35、A解析：[9,5,4]=180说明这样的数若存在则构成以180为周期的等差数列。三位数共999-100+1=900个，恰好是180的倍数。所以这样的三位数共900/180=5个。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:310", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:311", "text": "1.【答案】A第一组图形中，图一沿着对角线折叠后得到图二，第二沿着中线对折，得到图三；第二组图形同样遵循此规律，故答案为A。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:312", "text": "2.【答案】C图一右移后与图二叠加，取其最外围的图形轮廓，即为图三，据此规律，选C。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:313", "text": "3.【答案】C第一组图形中，图形角的数量逐次增加，分别为4、8、16；第二组前两图，图形边的数量逐次增加，分别为1、2，那么下图应为4条边，故答案为C。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:314", "text": "4.【答案】A左边一组中，图一第四行的第三格黑色方块位置保持不变，第二列的黑色方块每次上移1格，第三列第二行的黑色方块每次下移1格。据此规律，右边一组中，图一第四行第三列的黑色方块保持不变，第一行第一列的黑色方块每次上移1格，第二行第一列的黑色方块每次下移1格，故正确答案为A。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:315", "text": "5.【答案】B元素置换题。第一组图形中，图一图二叠加遵循：阴影方向不一致的叠加后变成黑色；阴影方向一致的，叠加后变成空白；阴影和空白叠加后变为阴影，且方向不变。第二组图形同样遵循此规律，故答案为B。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:316", "text": "6.B  7.E  8.D  9.A  10.D  11.C  12.A  13.A  14.E  15.A", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:317", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:318", "text": "1．C【解析】将表中各年度人数横向求和可知，1998年共有1720人，为人数最多的一年。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:319", "text": "2．B【解析】1997年青年男教师比上年增加120人，而上一年度增加100人，应选B。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:320", "text": "3．C【解析】1996～1998增加人数最多的应该是青年，增加了20人，增率为220÷100＝220%，应选C项。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:321", "text": "4．A【解析】1997年男教师为730人，女教师为360人，由730÷360≈2，应选A项。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:322", "text": "5．C【解析】由题意知，1998年的男教师最多，可排除A；女教师最少的是1996年，可排除B；1997年中年男教师比1996年多：320-240＝80（人）。故C项正确。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:323", "text": "6．B【解析】从文字材料可以直接看出，国泰摩托募集大量资金，投资4958．5万元用于焊接生产线技术改造，在（1）～（5）项中投资最大。所以，正确答案为B。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:324", "text": "7．A【解析】从文字材料可以看出，国泰摩托募集大量资金，“投资4883．6万元用于冲压生产技术改造，年创效益1475万元”，在（1）～（5）中，创效益最少。所以，正确答案为A。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:325", "text": "8．A【解析】从文字材料可以看出，国泰摩托募集大量资金投资4883．6万元用于冲压生产线技术改造；投资4958．5万元用于焊接生产线技术改造；投资4957．9万元用于发动机箱体、箱盖生产线技术改造；投资4955．3万元用于发动机曲轴连杆生产技术改造；投资4850．5万元用于塑料注塑成型加工生产线技术改造。所以，总共投资为：4883．6+4958．5+4957．9+4955．", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:326", "text": "3+4850．5=24605．8（万元）。故正确答案为A。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:327", "text": "9．A【解析】从文字材料可以看出，国泰摩托募集大量资金投资4883．6万元用于冲压生产线技术改造，年创效益1475万元；投资4958．5万元用于焊接生产线技术改造，年创效益1980万元；投资4957．9万元用于发动机箱体、箱盖生产线技术改造，年创效益2039．29万元；投资4955．3万元用于发动机曲轴连杆生产技术改造,年创效益2376．5万元；投资4850．5万元用于塑料注塑成型加工生产线技术改造，年创效益1980万元。所以，年创效益总共为：1475+1980+2039．29+2376．5+1980=9850．79（万元）。本题正确答案为A。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:328", "text": "10．A【解析】由118题和119题可以得知：年创效益共为9850．79万元，共投资为24605．8万元。所以，年创效益占投资额的比重为：9850．79÷24605．8=0．4003442≈40%。故正确答案为A。", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:329", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:330", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:331", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:332", "text": " ", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:333", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:334", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:335", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:336", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}, {"location": "paragraph:337", "text": "", "method": "word_com", "requires_visual_review": false}], "errors": [], "characters": 13850, "ocr_units": 0, "sparse_units": ["paragraph:1", "paragraph:3", "paragraph:64", "paragraph:71", "paragraph:72", "paragraph:73", "paragraph:75", "paragraph:78", "paragraph:81", "paragraph:84", "paragraph:87", "paragraph:119", "paragraph:120", "paragraph:121", "paragraph:122", "paragraph:123", "paragraph:201", "paragraph:202", "paragraph:203", "paragraph:205", "paragraph:206", "paragraph:207", "paragraph:208", "paragraph:209", "paragraph:210", "paragraph:211", "paragraph:212", "paragraph:213", "paragraph:214", "paragraph:215", "paragraph:216", "paragraph:217", "paragraph:218", "paragraph:219", "paragraph:220", "paragraph:221", "paragraph:222", "paragraph:223", "paragraph:224", "paragraph:225", "paragraph:226", "paragraph:227", "paragraph:228", "paragraph:229", "paragraph:230", "paragraph:231", "paragraph:232", "paragraph:233", "paragraph:234", "paragraph:235", "paragraph:236", "paragraph:237", "paragraph:238", "paragraph:239", "paragraph:240", "paragraph:241", "paragraph:242", "paragraph:243", "paragraph:244", "paragraph:278", "paragraph:281", "paragraph:282", "paragraph:310", "paragraph:317", "paragraph:329", "paragraph:330", "paragraph:331", "paragraph:332", "paragraph:333", "paragraph:334", "paragraph:335", "paragraph:336", "paragraph:337"]}